                    <button type="button" class="swr-multiplier-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white text-emerald-900 shadow-2xs border border-slate-200/60 transition-all cursor-pointer font-black" data-multiplier="30">
                        30× (Standard)
